  "content": "**Eureka 目前处于 ALPHA 测试阶段。请务必备份你的存档。游戏内可能会出现错误。**\n\n----\n\n<center>\n\n![Eureka!](https://i.imgur.com/PcXKgc6.png)\n\n[官网](https://valkyrienskies.org) | [Discord](https://discord.gg/dWwM8G3) | [GitHub](https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Eureka)\n</center>\n\nEureka 是一个简单的 _Valkyrien Skies_ 插件，它既符合原版美学风格，又易于使用且充满乐趣。\n\n使用普通的（或模组添加的！）Minecraft 方块建造并设计你自己的飞船，放置一个“船舵”，按住 Shift 右键点击进行组装，然后见证你的创作突然被注入物理引擎。你的 Minecraft 建筑不再永远静止不动，而是可以永恒地停留在同一位置。\n\n![Eureka! 方块](https://i.imgur.com/DaxvXa9.png)\n\n\n<iframe sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-popups allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-downloads allow-modals\" aria-label=\"YouTube Video, Create + Valkyrien Skies drill ship\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LuYnqaVUuQA\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" width=857 height=480></iframe>\n\n<iframe sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-popups allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-downloads allow-modals\" aria-label=\"YouTube Video, Eureka! Airships! (Valkyrien Skies) - Bit-By-Bit Minecraft mod 1.16 - Interactable Airships!\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o0Bf9gBGJwA\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" width=857 height=480></iframe>\n\n## 依赖项\n\n*注意：Eureka 内置了依赖项下载器，会自动为你完成所有繁琐的工作！只需下载 Eureka 的 JAR 文件并启动游戏即可。*\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\">Valkyrien Skies</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\">Architectury API</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\">Cloth Config API</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\">Kotlin For Forge (仅限 Forge 用户)</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\">Fabric API (仅限 Fabric 用户)</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\">Fabric Language Kotlin (仅限 Fabric 用户)</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\">Mod Menu (仅限 Fabric 用户)</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
